flowchart TD
  Cargo[Confirmed packed cargo] --> Dependency[Upper cargo blocks lower S4 access]
  Dependency --> Claim[Receiving reserves real source and warehouse cell]
  Claim --> Aisle[Freight reserves exclusive truck aisle]
  Aisle --> Walk[Same hauler walks to approved module-local start]
  Walk --> Open[Receiving deadline: worker-supported opening]
  Open --> Park[Positively locked and hands clear]
  Park --> Pickup[Existing real pickup, carry and warehouse deposit]
  Pickup --> Remaining{Lower cargo remains?}
  Remaining -->|yes| Park
  Remaining -->|no or return| CloseJob[Available actual hauler reserves closing work]
  CloseJob --> Close[Receiving deadline: supported closing and retraction]
  Close --> Exit[Actual worker exits and releases aisle]
  Exit --> Door[Freight stows ramp and closes door]
  Door --> Depart[Existing physical departure and optional return refund]
  Open --> Event[Activity event]
  Close --> Event
  Event --> View[Paired export views at same origin and time]
  View -. read only .-> Receiving[Receiving owns time, people and custody]
  Return[Return or reassignment during operation] --> Safe[Retain operator through hands-safe boundary]
  Safe --> Close
